## Review Checklist

### ViewComponent

- [ ] Inherits from `ApplicationComponent`
- [ ] `frozen_string_literal: true` on the Ruby file
- [ ] `initialize` uses keyword arguments
- [ ] Private `attr_reader` for instance variables
- [ ] No database queries inside the component — data is passed in
- [ ] Sidecar template (`.html.erb`) co-located with the `.rb` file
- [ ] YARD docs on `initialize` parameters
- [ ] Component has a spec in `spec/components/`
- [ ] Component has a Lookbook preview (when Lookbook is enabled)

### ERB / Templates

- [ ] All user-visible strings use `t('...')` for i18n
- [ ] No business logic in templates (move to component, helper, or model)
- [ ] No N+1 queries triggered by view code (collections eager-loaded by controller)
- [ ] Partials are rendered with explicit `locals:`
- [ ] `link_to` for navigation, `button_to` for state-changing actions
- [ ] Forms use `form_with` (NOT `form_for` or `form_tag`)

### Hotwire / Turbo

- [ ] `turbo_frame_tag` IDs are unique and descriptive
- [ ] Turbo Stream views are named `*.turbo_stream.erb`
- [ ] Form failures render with `:unprocessable_entity` so Turbo re-renders
- [ ] DELETE redirects use `:see_other`
- [ ] No `data-turbo="false"` unless explicitly needed (and documented why)

### Stimulus

- [ ] Controllers in `app/javascript/controllers/` follow `<name>_controller.js`
- [ ] Static `targets`, `values`, `classes` declarations
- [ ] Lifecycle methods (`connect`, `disconnect`) clean up event listeners
- [ ] No DOM queries via `document.querySelector` — use `this.targets`
- [ ] No global state — all state via `values` API
- [ ] One controller per responsibility

### Accessibility

- [ ] Images have `alt` attributes
- [ ] Form fields have visible labels (or `sr-only` labels)
- [ ] Buttons have descriptive text or `aria-label`
- [ ] Interactive elements are keyboard-accessible
- [ ] Headings use semantic order (`h1` → `h2` → `h3`)
- [ ] Color contrast meets WCAG AA (where checkable)
- [ ] ARIA attributes only added when semantic HTML alone isn't sufficient

### {{ variables.ui_library }}

- [ ] Class lists are readable — no `class="m-1 p-1 text-xs flex items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded border bg-white shadow hover:bg-gray-50 ..."` walls of utilities
- [ ] Repeated combinations extracted into a component or partial
- [ ] Responsive variants (`sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`) used correctly
- [ ] Dark mode variants (`dark:`) applied consistently if dark mode is supported

## Verdict Format

### APPROVED

```markdown
## Review: APPROVED

All checks passed. Code is ready to merge.

### Strengths
- <what was done well>
```

### NEEDS_CHANGES

```markdown
## Review: NEEDS_CHANGES

### Required Changes

1. **[file.html.erb:14]** Image is missing alt text
   - Fix: `<%= image_tag profile.avatar_url, alt: profile.name %>`
```

### BLOCKED

For accessibility regressions or fundamental Hotwire misuse.

## Common Issues to Flag

### DB query inside component (NEEDS_CHANGES)

```ruby
# BAD
class ProfileCardComponent < ApplicationComponent
  def initialize(profile_id:)
    @profile = Profile.find(profile_id)   # DB query in component
  end
end

# GOOD
class ProfileCardComponent < ApplicationComponent
  def initialize(profile:)
    @profile = profile   # caller passes the loaded record
  end
end
```

### Hardcoded English (NEEDS_CHANGES)

```erb
<!-- BAD -->
<button>Save changes</button>

<!-- GOOD -->
<button><%= t('profiles.form.save') %></button>
```

### Missing alt text (NEEDS_CHANGES — accessibility)

```erb
<!-- BAD -->
<%= image_tag profile.avatar_url %>

<!-- GOOD -->
<%= image_tag profile.avatar_url, alt: profile.name %>
```

### Inline JavaScript (NEEDS_CHANGES)

```erb
<!-- BAD -->
<button onclick="this.classList.toggle('active')">Toggle</button>

<!-- GOOD -->
<button data-controller="toggle" data-action="toggle#click" data-toggle-class="active">
  Toggle
</button>
```

### Form returns 200 on failure (BLOCKED — breaks Turbo)

```ruby
# In controller
render :new   # missing :unprocessable_entity → Turbo silently does nothing
```

### Tailwind class wall (NEEDS_CHANGES)

When the same long class string appears in 3+ places, extract it into a
ViewComponent or a presentation helper.

## Important Notes

- Be constructive, not critical
- Cite specific line numbers
- Explain WHY each issue matters (especially accessibility — link to WCAG when relevant)
- Suggest the fix
- BLOCKED is for accessibility regressions, security issues, or fundamental Hotwire misuse
